PaySim transaction history embedded in this scorer

Source: Synthetic Financial Datasets For Fraud Detection (PaySim)
Publisher: Edgar López-Rojas
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ealaxi/paysim1

Changes: Q-FraudGuard selected and normalized 79,532 transactions for the
scorer's feature history. Normalization includes generated transaction IDs
and timestamps derived from PaySim steps.

